  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4004.02 Prohibited Labels",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4004.02 Prohibited Labels. Any manufacturer of a portable fuel container or portable fuel container and spout not subject to or not in compliance with Env-A 4003 shall not display the phrase “Spill-Proof System” or “Spill-Proof Spout” on the portable fuel container or spout, respectively, on any sticker or label affixed thereto, or on any accompanying package.\n\nSource. #8358, eff 5-26-05; ss by #9064, eff 1-9-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4000.html"
